<title>SWEDEN: P&amp;U says to pay $0.27 dividend Q2 '97.</title>
<headline>P&amp;U says to pay $0.27 dividend Q2 '97.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S./Swedish drugs company Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn said on Tuesday it would pay out a dividend of 27 U.S. cents a share for the second quarter.</p>
</text>
